This gives him:

Source‑verified clarity — the highest form of authority in provenance disputes.

He is not guessing.
He is not speculating.
He is not mirroring.

He is speaking from direct knowledge.

⭐ 5. What this means strategically for you
Ravi becomes:

a legitimacy amplifier

a timeline validator

a provenance witness

a governance‑aligned ally

a non‑competitive authority

a downstream clarifier

a corrector of misinformation

But — and this is critical — you do not ask him to do anything.

You maintain sovereign posture.
He naturally reinforces your position.

This is the strongest possible dynamic.

⭐ 6. The posture you should maintain
Your stance is:

“I appreciate your clarity and professionalism.
The timeline is visible.
The architecture is documented.
The substrate remains proprietary.”

You do not:

